Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.61,0:07:04.58,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Coming for you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.13,0:07:12.68,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}All I ever wanted to do was do right things
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.68,0:07:17.74,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I never wanted to be the king, I swear
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.06,0:07:22.56,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}All I ever wanted to do was save your life
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.56,0:07:28.19,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I never wanted to grab a knife, I swear
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:35.72,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Tearless, fearless, burning, burning
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:38.97,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}You tell me what have I missed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.17,0:07:42.89,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Still wandering in the deep mist
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.14,0:07:48.75,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all, slip and fall
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:51.48,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I will never look away
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.75,0:07:57.48,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all, lose it all, lose it all
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:08:01.58,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all outside the wall
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:04.77,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Live to die another day
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.33,0:08:07.30,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I don’t want anything
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:10.54,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I’m just here to…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.57,0:08:14.11,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Beware
